{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261120%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　28庭　上訴庭法官高浩文<br/>女囚夏日須穿冬季長褲　鄒幸彤司法覆核敗訴｜宣布決定<br/>► 1030　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>瑜伽導師被殺案　前男友謀殺罪成｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　7庭　法官練錦鴻<br/>西醫戴港盛涉濫發「免針紙」案｜裁決<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違「23條」｜續審<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>（死因庭）<br/>► 1100　18庭　署理主任裁判官周慧珠<br/>女童周天瑜死因研訊｜研訊前檢討（非公開）</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　8庭　暫委裁判官莊靜慧<br/>被控沒用狗帶、所養拳師狗咬傷他人　前大埔區議員陳振哲被票控｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>66歲男子涉向鄧家彪陳沛良地區辦事處淋紅油｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>小學男教師涉校內偷拍｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.443323+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":521,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:49:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:14.455064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:29.459081+00:00","content_hash":"1b0c325d98f478e96359b3eee2bffe309bd49ee08447c3c270d716a6d5eb31d8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}